model g13_key_scen
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, pre-M1 (#97, chunk 4, G4a K1): the base of scenario s, which replaces a key-typed input's row: with a key of persons, ben, the scenario loads and answers (g13/key_scen); with zed, a key persons lacks, the scenario alone is refused LOAD-KEY at load and the base answers (g13/key_scen_bad; L §6.4, §8.3)"

source s "s"

input r5: rate

input n1: int

kind persons

input who: key persons

ask a: n1

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  r5 = 5 %/year "five"
  n1 = 1 "one"
  persons + [ana] lives 2026-01-01..
  persons + [ben] lives 2026-01-01..
  who = ana "a"
